OL,3,AUS voters go to polls to decide who
OL,4,Awill control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,8,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,9,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,10,Finvestigations into the president and
OL,11,Fhis team
OL,13,FAll polls are now open across the US,
OL,14,Fwith results due to come in from this
OL,15,Fevening in the US - our quick timetable
OL,16,Fis here
